id: power-gifter
name: Power Gifter
talentCategory: teamwork
prerequisites: N/A
description: >
  You are adept in sharing your energy with others with minimal loss of efficiency.
text: >
  Power Gifter: You are adept in sharing your energy with others with minimal loss of efficiency.
  –Prerequisites: N/A
  (1)-[Passive]: Through the Full Empowerment effect of the Empower Maneuver, you reduce your Capacity by 1/2 of your Max Capacity instead of reducing it to 0.
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If you spend 3 Actions on the Empower Maneuver, your targeted Ally may use the Power Up Maneuver or Transformation Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver.

---

[passive]
# (1) Full Empowerment: your Capacity down by half your Max Capacity, rounded down, not to 0 (use-maneuver.mjs transferKi).
allow empower.halfCapacity;
# (2) The Empower with 3 Actions: the Ally's Power Up and Transformation out of sequence, offered on its note - once a Round,
# yours, counted when one is taken (chat.mjs powerGifterOffers).
allow powerGifter.offer;
